<title>PERU: Peru's Telefonica Q3 net up 57 percent.</title>
<headline>Peru's Telefonica Q3 net up 57 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net per shr - 0.108 sol</p>
<p>Net per ADS - $0.47</p>
<p>Net - 252.3 million soles vs 160.8 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 794.4 million soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Telefonica del Peru, the Lima Stock Exchange's benchmark company, is majority-owned by Spain's Telefonica de Espana following.</p>
<p>-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134</p>
</text>
